    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53882" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταδέρκομαι</span></b> , aor.1
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατεδέρχθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					999
				</span></i>
			 (anap.): aor. 2
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατέδρᾰκον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			 (tm.):—poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθοράω</span>, <i>look down upon</i>, 
